.TH XIL\-STEM\-VERIFY "1" "2026\-07\-02" "xil\-pipeline 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xil\-stem\-verify \- scan a stems folder and produce a JSON report with file attributes and optional Whisper transcriptions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xil\-stem\-verify
[\-h] [\-\-show SLUG] [\-\-episode TAG] [\-\-stems\-dir DIR] [\-\-output FILE]
[\-\-whisper\-python PATH] [\-\-model SIZE] [\-\-language LANG]
[\-\-beam\-size N] [\-\-device {cuda,cpu}] [\-\-no\-transcribe]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scans every MP3 in a stems directory and writes a JSON report containing file
size, duration, bitrate, and (optionally) a Whisper transcript of each stem.
Useful for auditing TTS quality, catching silent files, or generating ground
truth transcriptions for comparison.
.PP
Transcription requires a separate
.B venv\-whisper
virtual environment containing
.B faster\-whisper
(or compatible).  Pass
.B \-\-no\-transcribe
to skip Whisper and report file attributes only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI\,SLUG\/\fR, \fB\-s\fR \fI\,SLUG\/\fR
Show slug (default: resolved from project.json or XIL_PROJECTROOT)
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR, \fB\-e\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR
Episode tag, e.g. S01E01 (required unless \fB\-\-stems\-dir\fR is set)
.TP
\fB\-\-stems\-dir\fR \fI\,DIR\/\fR
Override stems directory (default: \fI<workspace>\fR/stems/\fI<slug>\fR/\fI<episode>\fR/)
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR
Output JSON path (default: \fI<workspace>\fR/parsed/\fI<slug>\fR/stem_verify_\fI<episode>\fR.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-whisper\-python\fR \fI\,PATH\/\fR
Path to the venv\-whisper Python executable (auto\-detected if omitted)
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI\,SIZE\/\fR
Whisper model size: tiny|base|small|medium|large\-v3|large\-v3\-turbo
(default: large\-v3\-turbo)
.TP
\fB\-\-language\fR \fI\,LANG\/\fR
Language hint for Whisper.  Use
.B auto
for automatic detection (default: en)
.TP
\fB\-\-beam\-size\fR \fI\,N\/\fR
Whisper beam size (default: 5)
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR {cuda,cpu}
Compute device for Whisper (default: cuda)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-transcribe\fR
Skip Whisper transcription; output file attributes only (no GPU required)
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Verify and transcribe all stems for episode S01E01:
.B xil stem\-verify \-\-episode S01E01
.TP
File attributes only (no Whisper):
.B xil stem\-verify \-\-episode S01E01 \-\-no\-transcribe
.TP
Use a smaller model for faster transcription:
.B xil stem\-verify \-\-episode S01E01 \-\-model small
.TP
Run on CPU if no GPU is available:
.B xil stem\-verify \-\-episode S01E01 \-\-device cpu \-\-model base
